      "writtenOn": "2023-04-10T15:50:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just for my understanding, would we want to delete resources in this destructor? Or would we rely upon other classes to make sure that they call deleteResources() when needed? I see we have a TODO in the SharedContext destructor to consider performing a manual destruction of resources...",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 21,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 21,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "cc3b60eb26540355df197793871ac3452ca618dc",
